  "rationale": "Run 21 stopped at 6 concepts and INFERRED corpus-wide saturation. That is generalization-from-fragment, not measurement. Run 24 processes a stratified sample of 48 encyclopedia concepts (target >=40) with REAL web search per atom (R5), so the saturation finding (or its refutation) is empirical. All 48 are chosen to be OUTSIDE logs/candidate_pool.md's exhausted list. Maturity tier_prior is a PRIOR only; the empirical measure is actual atom paper-hits + ML-penetration from real search.",
